{"id":"ma-fig-006","s":"maths","t":"p1-12","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows the curve $y=x^2$ with points P and Q joined by a chord. Which option gives the gradient of chord PQ and the gradient of the curve at P?","o":["Chord PQ has gradient $12$; the curve has gradient $4$ at P","Chord PQ has gradient $6$; the curve has gradient $4$ at P","Chord PQ has gradient $6$; the curve has gradient $6$ at P","Chord PQ has gradient $6$; the curve has gradient $8$ at P"],"a":1,"x":"Reading P$(2,4)$ and Q$(4,16)$: chord gradient $=\\frac{16-4}{4-2}=6$. For the curve, $\\frac{dy}{dx}=2x=4$ at $x=2$. The chord gradient $2x+h=6$ is larger because $h=2$.","w":["Used the rise $16-4=12$ without dividing by the run of $2$.","","Assumed the chord gradient equals the tangent gradient at P; it only does so as $h\\to0$.","Evaluated $2x$ at Q ($x=4$) instead of at P ($x=2$)."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[-1,4],"y":[0,16],"xstep":1,"ystep":2,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[-1.0,1.0],[-0.96875,0.938477],[-0.9375,0.878906],[-0.90625,0.821289],[-0.875,0.765625],[-0.84375,0.711914],[-0.8125,0.660156],[-0.78125,0.610352],[-0.75,0.5625],[-0.71875,0.516602],[-0.6875,0.472656],[-0.65625,0.430664],[-0.625,0.390625],[-0.59375,0.352539],[-0.5625,0.316406],[-0.53125,0.282227],[-0.5,0.25],[-0.46875,0.219727],[-0.4375,0.191406],[-0.40625,0.165039],[-0.375,0.140625],[-0.34375,0.118164],[-0.3125,0.097656],[-0.28125,0.079102],[-0.25,0.0625],[-0.21875,0.047852],[-0.1875,0.035156],[-0.15625,0.024414],[-0.125,0.015625],[-0.09375,0.008789],[-0.0625,0.003906],[-0.03125,0.000977],[0.0,0.0],[0.03125,0.000977],[0.0625,0.003906],[0.09375,0.008789],[0.125,0.015625],[0.15625,0.024414],[0.1875,0.035156],[0.21875,0.047852],[0.25,0.0625],[0.28125,0.079102],[0.3125,0.097656],[0.34375,0.118164],[0.375,0.140625],[0.40625,0.165039],[0.4375,0.191406],[0.46875,0.219727],[0.5,0.25],[0.53125,0.282227],[0.5625,0.316406],[0.59375,0.352539],[0.625,0.390625],[0.65625,0.430664],[0.6875,0.472656],[0.71875,0.516602],[0.75,0.5625],[0.78125,0.610352],[0.8125,0.660156],[0.84375,0.711914],[0.875,0.765625],[0.90625,0.821289],[0.9375,0.878906],[0.96875,0.938477],[1.0,1.0],[1.03125,1.063477],[1.0625,1.128906],[1.09375,1.196289],[1.125,1.265625],[1.15625,1.336914],[1.1875,1.410156],[1.21875,1.485352],[1.25,1.5625],[1.28125,1.641602],[1.3125,1.722656],[1.34375,1.805664],[1.375,1.890625],[1.40625,1.977539],[1.4375,2.066406],[1.46875,2.157227],[1.5,2.25],[1.53125,2.344727],[1.5625,2.441406],[1.59375,2.540039],[1.625,2.640625],[1.65625,2.743164],[1.6875,2.847656],[1.71875,2.954102],[1.75,3.0625],[1.78125,3.172852],[1.8125,3.285156],[1.84375,3.399414],[1.875,3.515625],[1.90625,3.633789],[1.9375,3.753906],[1.96875,3.875977],[2.0,4.0],[2.03125,4.125977],[2.0625,4.253906],[2.09375,4.383789],[2.125,4.515625],[2.15625,4.649414],[2.1875,4.785156],[2.21875,4.922852],[2.25,5.0625],[2.28125,5.204102],[2.3125,5.347656],[2.34375,5.493164],[2.375,5.640625],[2.40625,5.790039],[2.4375,5.941406],[2.46875,6.094727],[2.5,6.25],[2.53125,6.407227],[2.5625,6.566406],[2.59375,6.727539],[2.625,6.890625],[2.65625,7.055664],[2.6875,7.222656],[2.71875,7.391602],[2.75,7.5625],[2.78125,7.735352],[2.8125,7.910156],[2.84375,8.086914],[2.875,8.265625],[2.90625,8.446289],[2.9375,8.628906],[2.96875,8.813477],[3.0,9.0],[3.03125,9.188477],[3.0625,9.378906],[3.09375,9.571289],[3.125,9.765625],[3.15625,9.961914],[3.1875,10.160156],[3.21875,10.360352],[3.25,10.5625],[3.28125,10.766602],[3.3125,10.972656],[3.34375,11.180664],[3.375,11.390625],[3.40625,11.602539],[3.4375,11.816406],[3.46875,12.032227],[3.5,12.25],[3.53125,12.469727],[3.5625,12.691406],[3.59375,12.915039],[3.625,13.140625],[3.65625,13.368164],[3.6875,13.597656],[3.71875,13.829102],[3.75,14.0625],[3.78125,14.297852],[3.8125,14.535156],[3.84375,14.774414],[3.875,15.015625],[3.90625,15.258789],[3.9375,15.503906],[3.96875,15.750977],[4.0,16.0]],"c":0,"label":"y = x²"},{"pts":[[2,4],[4,16]],"dash":true,"c":1}],"points":[{"at":[2,4],"label":"P"},{"at":[4,16],"label":"Q"}],"xnums":t