{"id":"ma-fig-020","s":"maths","t":"p1-09","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows a trigonometric curve with $x$ in degrees. Which equation gives this curve?","o":["$y=3\\cos 2x$","$y=2\\sin 2x+1$","$y=2\\cos 2x+1$","$y=2\\cos\\left(\\frac{x}{2}\\right)+1$"],"a":2,"x":"The maximum is 3 and the minimum is $-1$, so $c=1$ and $a=2$. One full cycle takes $180^\\circ$, so $b=360/180=2$. The curve starts at its maximum at $x=0$, so it is cosine.","w":["Takes $a$ as the maximum value 3 and ignores the vertical shift $c=1$, so the curve would swing between $-3$ and $3$.","Uses sine, but a sine curve would start on the midline at $x=0$. This curve starts at its maximum.","","Inverts the stretch: period $180^\\circ$ gives $b=2$, not $b=\\frac12$, which would give a period of $720^\\circ$."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,360],"y":[-2,4],"xstep":45,"ystep":1,"xlabel":"x / °","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[0.0,3.0],[2.25,2.993835],[4.5,2.975377],[6.75,2.94474],[9.0,2.902113],[11.25,2.847759],[13.5,2.782013],[15.75,2.70528],[18.0,2.618034],[20.25,2.520812],[22.5,2.414214],[24.75,2.298896],[27.0,2.175571],[29.25,2.044997],[31.5,1.907981],[33.75,1.765367],[36.0,1.618034],[38.25,1.466891],[40.5,1.312869],[42.75,1.156918],[45.0,1.0],[47.25,0.843082],[49.5,0.687131],[51.75,0.533109],[54.0,0.381966],[56.25,0.234633],[58.5,0.092019],[60.75,-0.044997],[63.0,-0.175571],[65.25,-0.298896],[67.5,-0.414214],[69.75,-0.520812],[72.0,-0.618034],[74.25,-0.70528],[76.5,-0.782013],[78.75,-0.847759],[81.0,-0.902113],[83.25,-0.94474],[85.5,-0.975377],[87.75,-0.993835],[90.0,-1.0],[92.25,-0.993835],[94.5,-0.975377],[96.75,-0.94474],[99.0,-0.902113],[101.25,-0.847759],[103.5,-0.782013],[105.75,-0.70528],[108.0,-0.618034],[110.25,-0.520812],[112.5,-0.414214],[114.75,-0.298896],[117.0,-0.175571],[119.25,-0.044997],[121.5,0.092019],[123.75,0.234633],[126.0,0.381966],[128.25,0.533109],[130.5,0.687131],[132.75,0.843082],[135.0,1.0],[137.25,1.156918],[139.5,1.312869],[141.75,1.466891],[144.0,1.618034],[146.25,1.765367],