{"id":"ma-fig-055","s":"maths","t":"p2-09","lv":3,"q":"The graph shows the curve $x^2+xy+y^2=7$ with the point P marked. Use the graph to read the coordinates of P, then find $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ at P.","o":["$-\\frac45$","$-1$","$\\frac54$","$-\\frac54$"],"a":3,"x":"P is $(2,1)$. Differentiating implicitly: $2x+y+x\\frac{dy}{dx}+2y\\frac{dy}{dx}=0$, so $\\frac{dy}{dx}=-\\frac{2x+y}{x+2y}=-\\frac54$. The curve slopes downwards at P, which agrees.","w":["Found $-\\frac{x+2y}{2x+y}$, putting the gradient upside down when rearranging.","Differentiated $xy$ as $x\\frac{dy}{dx}$, missing the $y$ from the product rule.","Lost the minus sign when rearranging. The graph clearly slopes downwards at P.",""],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[-4,4],"y":[-4,4],"xstep":1,"ystep":1,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[-3.0551,1.5275],[-3,2],[-2.8,2.4583],[-2.5,2.7707],[-2,3],[-1.5,3.0549],[-1,3],[-0.5,2.8601],[0,2.6458],[0.5,2.3601],[1,2],[1.5,1.5549],[2,1],[2.5,0.2707],[2.8,-0.3417],[3,-1],[3.0551,-1.5275],[3,-2],[2.8,-2.4583],[2.5,-2.7707],[2,-3],[1.5,-3.0549],[1,-3],[0.5,-2.8601],[0,-2.6458],[-0.5,-2.3601],[-1,-2],[-1.5,-1.5549],[-2,-1],[-2.5,-0.2707],[-2.8,0.3417],[-3,1],[-3.0551,1.5275]],"c":0}],"points":[{"at":[2,1],"label":"P"}],"xnums":true,"ynums":true}}
{"id":"ma-fig-022","s":"maths","t":"p1-12","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows a curve and the tangent to it at P. Which option is the equation of the normal to the curve at P?","o":["$y=3x-4$","$3y=x+4$","$y=-3x+8$","$3y=8-x$"],"a":1,"x":"The tangent passes through $(0,8)$ and $(4,-4)$, so its gradient is $-12\\div4=-3$. The normal has gradient $\\frac13$ and passes through $P(2,2)$: $y-2=\\frac13(x-2)$, so $3y=x+4$.","w":["Changed the sign of the tangent gradient but did not take the reciprocal, giving gradient 3.","","Gave the equation of the tangent itself instead of the normal.","Took the reciprocal but kept the negative sign, so the gradient $-\\frac13$ is not perpendicular to the tangent."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,4],"y":[-4,8],"xstep":1,"ystep":2,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[0.0,0.0],[0.025,0.221266],[0.05,0.435125],[0.075,0.641672],[0.1,0.841],[0.125,1.033203],[0.15,1.218375],[0.175,1.396609],[0.2,1.568],[0.225,1.732641],[0.25,1.890625],[0.275,2.042047],[0.3,2.187],[0.325,2.325578],[0.35,2.457875],[0.375,2.583984],[0.4,2.704],[0.425,2.818016],[0.45,2.926125],[0.475,3.028422],[0.5,3.125],[0.525,3.215953],[0.55,3.301375],[0.575,3.381359],[0.6,3.456],[0.625,3.525391],[0.65,3.589625],[0.675,3.648797],[0.7,3.703],[0.725,3.752328],[0.75,3.796875],[0.775,3.836734],[0.8,3.872],[0.825,3.902766],[0.85,3.929125],[0.875,3.951172],[0.9,3.969],[0.925,3.982703],[0.95,3.992375],[0.975,3.998109],[1.0,4.0],[1.025,3.998141],[1.05,3.992625],[1.075,3.983547],[1.1,3.971],[1.125,3.955078],[1.15,3.935875],[1.175,3.913484],[1.2,3.888],[1.225,3.859516],[1.25,3.828125],[1.275,3.793922],[1.3,3.757],[1.325,3.717453],[1.35,3.675375],[1.375,3.630859],[1.4,3.584],[1.425,3.534891],[1.45,3.483625],[1.475,3.430297],[1.5,3.375],[1.525,3.317828],[1.55,3.258875],[1.575,3.198234],[1.6,3.136],[1.625,3.072266],[1.65,3.007125],[1.675,2.940672],[1.7,2.873],[1.725,2.804203],[1.75,2.734375],[1.775,2.663609],[1.8,2.592],[1.825,2.519641],[1.85,2.446625],[1.875,2.373047],[1.9,2.299],[1.925,2.