{"id":"ma-fig-013","s":"maths","t":"p1-03","lv":3,"q":"The graph shows curve C and line L. Find all $x$ for which C is on or above L and, at the same time, C is on or below the $x$-axis.","o":["$-2\\le x\\le 4$","$x\\le 0$ or $x\\ge 4$","$-2\\le x\\le 0$","$-2\\le x\\le 0$ or $x=4$"],"a":3,"x":"C meets L at $x=0$ and $x=4$, and is on or above L for $x\\le0$ or $x\\ge4$. C is on or below the $x$-axis for $-2\\le x\\le4$. Both hold for $-2\\le x\\le0$ and at $x=4$.","w":["Used only the condition that C is below the $x$-axis and ignored L.","Used only the condition that C is above L and ignored the $x$-axis.","Found the overlap but dropped the isolated point $x=4$, where C meets both L and the $x$-axis.",""],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[-3,5],"y":[-10,8],"xstep":1,"ystep":2,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[-3.0,7.0],[-2.95,6.6025],[-2.9,6.21],[-2.85,5.8225],[-2.8,5.44],[-2.75,5.0625],[-2.7,4.69],[-2.65,4.3225],[-2.6,3.96],[-2.55,3.6025],[-2.5,3.25],[-2.45,2.9025],[-2.4,2.56],[-2.35,2.2225],[-2.3,1.89],[-2.25,1.5625],[-2.2,1.24],[-2.15,0.9225],[-2.1,0.61],[-2.05,0.3025],[-2.0,0.0],[-1.95,-0.2975],[-1.9,-0.59],[-1.85,-0.8775],[-1.8,-1.16],[-1.75,-1.4375],[-1.7,-1.71],[-1.65,-1.9775],[-1.6,-2.24],[-1.55,-2.4975],[-1.5,-2.75],[-1.45,-2.9975],[-1.4,-3.24],[-1.35,-3.4775],[-1.3,-3.71],[-1.25,-3.9375],[-1.2,-4.16],[-1.15,-4.3775],[-1.1,-4.59],[-1.05,-4.7975],[-1.0,-5.0],[-0.95,-5.1975],[-0.9,-5.39],[-0.85,-5.5775],[-0.8,-5.76],[-0.75,-5.9375],[-0.7,-6.11],[-0.65,-6.2775],[-0.6,-6.44],[-0.55,-6.5975],[-0.5,-6.75],[-0.45,-6.8975],[-0.4,-7.04],[-0.35,-7.1775],[-0.3,-7.31],[-0.25,-7.4375],[-0.2,-7.56],[-0.15,-7.6775],[-0.1,-7.79],[-0.05,-7.8975],[0.0,-8.0],[0.05,-8.0975],[0.1,-8.19],[0.15,-8.2775],[0.2,-8.36],[0.25,-8.4375],[0.3,-8.51],[0.35,-8.5775],[0.4,-8.64],[0.45,-8.6975],[0.5,-8.75],[0.55,-8.7975],[0.6,-8.84],[0.65,-8.8775],[0.7,-8.91],[0.75,-8.9375],[0.8,-8.96],[0.85,-8.9775],[0.9,-8.99],[0.95,-8.9975],[1.0,-9.0],[1.05,-8.9975],[1.1,-8.99],[1.15,-8.9775],[1.2,-8.9