{"id":"ma-fig-061","s":"maths","t":"m2-06","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows the path of a projectile launched from level ground. The dashed line is the tangent at the launch point. Taking $g=9.8$, what is the launch speed?","o":["14.0 m s⁻¹","19.8 m s⁻¹","28.0 m s⁻¹","9.9 m s⁻¹"],"a":1,"x":"The highest point P is 10 m up, so $u_y^2=2\\times9.8\\times10=196$ and $u_y=14$. The tangent has gradient 1, so $u_x=u_y=14$. Speed $=\\sqrt{14^2+14^2}\\approx19.8$ m s⁻¹.","w":["Found only the vertical component from the maximum height and forgot the horizontal component.","","Added the components $14+14$ instead of combining them with Pythagoras.","Multiplied the vertical component 14 by $\\sin45^\\circ$ instead of dividing by it."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,40],"y":[0,12],"xstep":5,"ystep":2,"xlabel":"horizontal distance / m","ylabel":"height / m","lines":[{"pts":[[0.0,0.0],[0.25,0.248438],[0.5,0.49375],[0.75,0.735938],[1.0,0.975],[1.25,1.210938],[1.5,1.44375],[1.75,1.673437],[2.0,1.9],[2.25,2.123438],[2.5,2.34375],[2.75,2.560938],[3.0,2.775],[3.25,2.985937],[3.5,3.19375],[3.75,3.398438],[4.0,3.6],[4.25,3.798437],[4.5,3.99375],[4.75,4.185937],[5.0,4.375],[5.25,4.560937],[5.5,4.74375],[5.75,4.923438],[6.0,5.1],[6.25,5.273438],[6.5,5.44375],[6.75,5.610938],[7.0,5.775],[7.25,5.935937],[7.5,6.09375],[7.75,6.248437],[8.0,6.4],[8.25,6.548438],[8.5,6.69375],[8.75,6.835938],[9.0,6.975],[9.25,7.110938],[9.5,7.24375],[9.75,7.373437],[10.0,7.5],[10.25,7.623437],[10.5,7.74375],[10.75,7.860938],[11.0,7.975],[11.25,8.085938],[11.5,8.19375],[11.75,8.298438],[12.0,8.4],[12.25,8.498437],[12.5,8.59375],[12.75,8.685937],[13.0,8.775],[13.25,8.860938],[13.5,8.94375],[13.75,9.023438],[14.0,9.1],[14.25,9.173438],[14.5,9.24375],[14.75,9.310937],[15.0,9.375],[15.25,9.435937],[15.5,9.49375],[15.75,9.548438],[16.0,9.6],[16.25,9.648438],[16.5,9.69375],[16.75,9.735938],[17.0,9.775],[17.25,9.810937],[17.5,9.84375],[17.75,9.873437],[18.0,9.9],[18.25,9.923438],[18.5,9.94375],[18.75,9.960938],[19.0,9.975],[19.