{"id":"ma-fig-057","s":"maths","t":"p2-11","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows $y=x\\sqrt{4-x^2}$, which meets the x-axis again at P. Use a substitution to find the exact area between the curve and the x-axis from the origin to P.","o":["$\\frac{8}{3}$","$\\frac{16}{3}$","$\\frac{4}{3}$","$\\frac{8-2\\sqrt{2}}{3}$"],"a":0,"x":"The graph shows P at $x=2$. Let $u=4-x^2$, so $x\\,dx=-\\tfrac12du$. Area $=\\tfrac12\\int_0^4u^{1/2}du=\\tfrac12\\cdot\\tfrac23\\cdot 8=\\tfrac83$.","w":["","Left out the factor $\\tfrac12$ from $du=-2x\\,dx$.","Applied the factor $\\tfrac12$ twice, for example by also halving when integrating $u^{1/2}$.","Used the turning point (maximum) as the upper limit instead of P, where the curve meets the x-axis."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,2],"y":[0,2.5],"xstep":0.5,"ystep":0.5,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[0.0,0.0],[0.0125,0.025],[0.025,0.049996],[0.0375,0.074987],[0.05,0.099969],[0.0625,0.124939],[0.075,0.149894],[0.0875,0.174832],[0.1,0.19975],[0.1125,0.224644],[0.125,0.249511],[0.1375,0.274349],[0.15,0.299155],[0.1625,0.323925],[0.175,0.348658],[0.1875,0.373348],[0.2,0.397995],[0.2125,0.422594],[0.225,0.447143],[0.2375,0.471639],[0.25,0.496078],[0.2625,0.520458],[0.275,0.544776],[0.2875,0.569028],[0.3,0.593212],[0.3125,0.617323],[0.325,0.641361],[0.3375,0.66532],[0.35,0.689198],[0.3625,0.712992],[0.375,0.736698],[0.3875,0.760314],[0.4,0.783837],[0.4125,0.807262],[0.425,0.830587],[0.4375,0.853808],[0.45,0.876923],[0.4625,0.899927],[0.475,0.922818],[0.4875,0.945592],[0.5,0.968246],[0.5125,0.990776],[0.525,1.013179],[0.5375,1.035451],[0.55,1.057589],[0.5625,1.079589],[0.575,1.101448],[0.5875,1.123162],[0.6,1.144727],[0.6125,1.16614],[0.625,1.187397],[0.6375,1.208495],[0.65,1.229428],[0.6625,1.250195],[0.675,1.270789],[0.6875,1.291209],[0.7,1.31145],[0.7125,1.331507],[0.725,1.351376],[0.7375,1.371055],[0.75,1.390537],[0.7625,1.40982],[0.775,1.428898],[0.7875,1.447768],[0.8,1.466424],[0.8125,1.484863],[0.825,1.50308],[0.8375,1.52107],[0.85,1.