{"id":"ma-fig-042","s":"maths","t":"m1-11","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows the acceleration of a particle that starts from rest at $t=0$. Find the greatest velocity the particle reaches.","o":["$8\\text{ m s}^{-1}$","$12\\text{ m s}^{-1}$","$32\\text{ m s}^{-1}$","$16\\text{ m s}^{-1}$"],"a":3,"x":"Area under an acceleration-time graph gives the change in velocity. Velocity is greatest when $a$ reaches 0, at $t=4$. The area is $\\frac12\\times4\\times8=16$ m s⁻¹.","w":["Reads the greatest acceleration from the vertical axis and gives it as the greatest velocity.","Uses the net area up to $t=6$, subtracting the area below the axis. That gives the velocity at $t=6$, not the greatest.","Uses base times height for the area, forgetting the factor $\\frac12$ for a triangle.",""],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,6],"y":[-4,8],"xstep":1,"ystep":2,"xlabel":"time / s","ylabel":"acceleration / m s⁻²","lines":[{"pts":[[0,8],[4,0],[6,-4]],"c":0}],"xnums":true,"ynums":true}}
{"id":"ma-fig-043","s":"maths","t":"m1-11","lv":3,"q":"The graph shows the displacement of a particle from a fixed point O. At which time is the particle instantaneously at rest with positive acceleration?","o":["$t=3$ s","$t=1$ s","$t=2$ s","$t=4$ s"],"a":0,"x":"At rest means zero gradient: $t=1$ and $t=3$. Acceleration is the rate of change of gradient. At $t=3$ the curve is a minimum, concave up, so the acceleration is positive. At $t=1$ it is negative.","w":["","Spots a turning point but it is a maximum, where the curve is concave down, so the acceleration is negative.","Picks the point of inflection, where acceleration is zero. The particle is moving there, not at rest.","Picks the end of the graph, where the displacement is back at its largest. The gradient is positive there, so it is not at rest."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,4],"y":[0,5],"xstep":1,"ystep":1,"xlabel":"time / s","ylabel":"displacement / m","lines":[{"pts":[[0.0,0.0],[0.025,0.221266],[0.05,0.435125],[0.075,0.641672],[0.1,0.841],[0.125,1.033203],[0.15,1.218375],[0.175,1.396609],[0.2,1.568],[0.225,1.732641],[0.25,1.890625],[0.275,2.042047],[0.3,2.187],[0.325,2.325578],[0.35,2.457875],[0.375,2.583984],[0.4,2.704],[0.425,2.818016],[0.45,2.926125],[0.475,3.028422],[0.5,3.125],[0.525,3.215953],[0.55,3.301375],[0.575,3.381359],[0.6,3.456],[0.625,3.525391],[0.65,3.589625],[0.675,3.648797],[0.7,3.703],[0.725,3.752328],[0.75,3.796875],[0.775,3.836734],[0.8,3.872],[0.825,3.902766],[0.85,3.929125],[0.875,3.951172],[0.9,3.969],[0.925,3.982703],[0.95,3.992375],[0.975,3.998109],[1.0,4.0],[1.025,3.998141],[1.05,3.992625],[1.075,3.983547],[1.1,3.971],[1.125,3.955078],[1.15,3.935875],[1.175,3.913484],[1.2,3.888],[1.225,3.859516],[1.25,3.828125],[1.275,3.793922],[1.3,3.757],[1.325,3.717453],[1.35,3.675375],[1.375,3.630859],[1.4,3.584],[1.425,3.534891],[1.45,3.483625],[1.475,3.430297],[1.5,3.375],[1.525,3.317828],[1.55,3.258875],[1.575,3.198234],[1.6,3.136],[1.625,3.072266],[1.65,3.007125],[1.675,2.940672],[1.7,2