{"id":"ma-fig-030","s":"maths","t":"p1-14","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows the mass $M$ of a radioactive sample, modelled by $M=M_0e^{-kt}$ with $t$ in days. Use the graph to find $k$ to 3 significant figures.","o":["$0.139$ per day","$0.200$ per day","$0.0693$ per day","$0.277$ per day"],"a":0,"x":"The mass falls from 80 g at $t=0$ to 20 g at $t=10$, which is two halvings. So the half-life is 5 days and $k=\\frac{\\ln2}{5}=0.139$ per day.","w":["","Used $k=\\frac{1}{\\text{half-life}}$, which is not the relationship. It should be $\\frac{\\ln 2}{\\text{half-life}}$.","Took the half-life as 10 days, the time to reach P, though P is two halvings from the start.","Used $\\frac{\\ln 4}{5}$, mixing the fall to P with a half-life of 5 days."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,20],"y":[0,80],"xstep":5,"ystep":10,"xlabel":"time / days","ylabel":"mass / g","lines":[{"pts":[[0.0,80.0],[0.125,78.625648],[0.25,77.274906],[0.375,75.94737],[0.5,74.642639],[0.625,73.360323],[0.75,72.100037],[0.875,70.861402],[1.0,69.644045],[1.125,68.447602],[1.25,67.271713],[1.375,66.116025],[1.5,64.980192],[1.625,63.863871],[1.75,62.766728],[1.875,61.688433],[2.0,60.628663],[2.125,59.587099],[2.25,58.563428],[2.375,57.557343],[2.5,56.568542],[2.625,55.596729],[2.75,54.64161],[2.875,53.7029],[3.0,52.780316],[3.125,51.873582],[3.25,50.982425],[3.375,50.106578],[3.5,49.245777],[3.625,48.399764],[3.75,47.568285],[3.875,46.75109],[4.0,45.947934],[4.125,45.158576],[4.25,44.382779],[4.375,43.620309],[4.5,42.870939],[4.625,42.134441],[4.75,41.410597],[4.875,40.699188],[5.0,40.0],[5.125,39.312824],[5.25,38.637453],[5.375,37.973685],[5.5,37.32132],[5.625,36.680162],[5.75,36.050019],[5.875,35.430701],[6.0,34.822023],[6.125,34.223801],[6.25,33.635857],[6.375,33.058013],[6.5,32.490096],[6.625,31.931935],[6.75,31.383364],[6.875,30.844217],[7.0,30.314331],[7.125,29.793549],[7.25,29.281714],[7.375,28.778672],[7.5,28.284271],[7.625,27.798364],[7.75,27.320805],[7.875,26.85145],[8.0,26.390158],[8.125,25.936791],[8.25,25.4