{"id":"ma-fig-031","s":"maths","t":"p1-14","lv":3,"q":"Data satisfying $y=ab^x$ are plotted as $\\log_{10}y$ against $x$, giving the straight line in the graph. Use the graph to find $b$ to 3 significant figures.","o":["$-0.5$","$0.607$","$3.16$","$0.316$"],"a":3,"x":"$\\log_{10}y=\\log_{10}a+x\\log_{10}b$. The line starts at 3 and meets the axis at $x=6$, so the gradient is $-\\frac36=-0.5$. Then $b=10^{-0.5}=0.316$.","w":["Gave the gradient itself as $b$. The gradient is $\\log_{10}b$, so $b$ needs to be found from it.","Used $e^{-0.5}$, but the graph uses base 10 logarithms, so $b=10^{-0.5}$.","Lost the sign of the gradient, using $10^{0.5}$. The line slopes downwards, so the gradient is negative.",""],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,7],"y":[0,4],"xstep":1,"ystep":0.5,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"log₁₀ y","lines":[{"pts":[[0,3],[6,0]],"c":0}],"xnums":true,"ynums":true}}
{"id":"ma-fig-032","s":"maths","t":"p1-14","lv":3,"q":"The graph shows $y=Ae^{kx}$ and the tangent at P, the point where the curve crosses the vertical axis. Use the graph and the gradient of $e^{kx}$ to find $k$.","o":["$k=1$","$k=2$","$k=0.5$","$k=\\ln 2$"],"a":2,"x":"At P, $y=2$, so $A=2$. The tangent passes through $(-2,0)$ and $(2,4)$, so its gradient is 1. Since $\\frac{dy}{dx}=ky$, $1=k\\times2$ and $k=0.5$.","w":["Took the tangent gradient as $k$, forgetting that the gradient at P is $ky=2k$.","Divided $y$ by the gradient, which turns $\\frac{\\text{gradient}}{y}$ upside down.","","Used $k=\\ln A$ because $A=2$. The value of $k$ comes from the gradient condition $\\frac{dy}{dx}=ky$."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[-3,2],"y":[0,6],"xstep":1,"ystep":1,"xlabel":"x","ylabel":"y","lines":[{"pts":[[-3.0,0.44626],[-2.96875,0.453288],[-2.9375,0.460426],[-2.90625,0.467677],[-2.875,0.475042],[-2.84375,0.482522],[-2.8125,0.490121],[-2.78125,0.497839],[-2.75,0.505679],[-2.71875,0.513642],[-2.6875,0.521731],[-2.65625,0.529947],[-2.625,0.538293],[-2.59375,0.54677],[-2.5625,0.55538],[-2.53125,0.564126],[-2.5,0.57301],[-2.46875,0.582033],[-2.4375,0.591199],[-2.40625,0.600509],[-2.375,0.609966],[-2.34375,0.619571],[-2.3125,0.629328],[-2.28125,0.639238],[-2.25,0.649305],[-2.21875,0.65953],[-2.1875,0.669916],[-2.15625,0.680466],[-2.125,0.691182],[-2.09375,0.702066],[-2.0625,0.713122],[-2.03125,0.724352],[-2.0,0.735759],[-1.96875,0.747345],[-1.9375,0.759114],[-1.90625,0.771069],[-1.875,0.783211],[-1.84375,0.795545],[-1.8125,0.808073],[-1.78125,0.820798],[-1.75,0.833724],[-1.71875,0.846853],[-1.6875,0.860189],[-1.65625,0.873735],[-1.625,0.887495],[-1.59375,0.901471],[-1.5625,0.915667],[-1.53125,0.930086],[-1.5,0.944733],[-1.46875,0.95961],[-1.4375,0.974722],[-1.40625,0.990072],[-1.375,1.005663],[-1.34375,1.0215],[-1.3125,1.037586],[-1.28125,1.053926],[-1.25,1.070523],[-1.21875,1.087381],[-1.1875,1.104505],[-1.15625,1.121898],[-1.125,1.139566],[-1.09375,1.157511],[-1.0625,1.175739],