{"id":"ma-fig-036","s":"maths","t":"m1-09","lv":2,"q":"A ball is thrown vertically upwards from ground level on another planet. The graph shows its velocity, with upwards as positive. Find the greatest height of the ball above the ground.","o":["24 m","0 m","12 m","6 m"],"a":2,"x":"The ball is at its highest when $v=0$, at $t=2$ s. Height = area of the triangle under the line from $t=0$ to $t=2$: $\\frac12\\times2\\times12=12$ m.","w":["Takes rectangle $12\\times2$, forgetting the $\\frac12$ for a triangle.","Uses the whole 4 s, when the ball has returned to the ground and the net displacement is zero.","","Takes the size of the gradient, 6, as the height instead of finding an area."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,4],"y":[-12,12],"xstep":1,"ystep":4,"xlabel":"time / s","ylabel":"velocity / m/s","lines":[{"pts":[[0,12],[4,-12]],"c":0}],"xnums":true,"ynums":true}}
{"id":"ma-fig-037","s":"maths","t":"m1-09","lv":3,"q":"A and B start from the same point at the same time. The graph shows their displacements. A has constant velocity; B starts from rest with constant acceleration. They meet at P. Find B's acceleration.","o":["0.75 m/s²","1.5 m/s²","3 m/s²","6 m/s²"],"a":1,"x":"P is at $t=4$ s, $s=12$ m. B starts from rest, so $s=\\frac12at^2$. Then $12=\\frac12a(16)$, so $a=1.5$ m/s².","w":["Uses $s=at^2$ and forgets the $\\frac12$, giving $12\\div16$.","","Reads the gradient of A, which is its constant velocity, not the acceleration of B.","Uses $a=2s/t$ instead of $2s/t^2$, forgetting to square the time."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,5],"y":[0,20],"xstep":1,"ystep":4,"xlabel":"time / s","ylabel":"displacement / m","lines":[{"pts":[[0.0,0.0],[0.03125,0.09375],[0.0625,0.1875],[0.09375,0.28125],[0.125,0.375],[0.15625,0.46875],[0.1875,0.5625],[0.21875,0.65625],[0.25,0.75],[0.28125,0.84375],[0.3125,0.9375],[0.34375,1.03125],[0.375,1.125],[0.40625,1.21875],[0.4375,1.3125],[0.46875,1.40625],[0.5,1.5],[0.53125,1.59375],[0.5625,1.6875],[0.59375,1.78125],[0.625,1.875],[0.65625,1.96875],[0.6875,2.0625],[0.71875,2.15625],[0.75,2.25],[0.78125,2.34375],[0.8125,2.4375],[0.84375,2.53125],[0.875,2.625],[0.90625,2.71875],[0.9375,2.8125],[0.96875,2.90625],[1.0,3.0],[1.03125,3.09375],[1.0625,3.1875],[1.09375,3.28125],[1.125,3.375],[1.15625,3.46875],[1.1875,3.5625],[1.21875,3.65625],[1.25,3.75],[1.28125,3.84375],[1.3125,3.9375],[1.34375,4.03125],[1.375,4.125],[1.40625,4.21875],[1.4375,4.3125],[1.46875,4.40625],[1.5,4.5],[1.53125,4.59375],[1.5625,4.6875],[1.59375,4.78125],[1.625,4.875],[1.65625,4.96875],[1.6875,5.0625],[1.71875,5.15625],[1.75,5.25],[1.78125,5.34375],[1.8125,5.4375],[1.84375,5.53125],[1.875,5.625],[1.90625,5.71875],[1.9375,5.8125],[1.96875,5.90625],[2.0,6.0],[2.03125,6.09375],[2.0625,6.1875],[2.09375,6.28125],[2.125,6.375],[2.15625,6.46875],[2.1875,6.5625],[2.21875,6.65625],[2.25,6.75],[2.28125,6.84375],[2.3125,6.9375],[2.34375,7.031