{"id":"ma-fig-065","s":"maths","t":"m1-09","lv":2,"q":"A ball is thrown vertically upwards. The graph shows its velocity, with upwards positive. Find the ball's height above its launch point at the instant marked P.","o":["25 m","20 m","15 m","5 m"],"a":2,"x":"The line meets v = 0 at t = 2 s. Area 0–2 s: ½ × 2 × 20 = 20 m up. Area 2–3 s (to P): ½ × 1 × 10 = 5 m down. Height = 20 − 5 = 15 m.","w":["Gives the total distance travelled, adding the 5 m falling stage instead of subtracting it from the upward displacement.","Gives the greatest height, at the top where v = 0, and ignores the ball falling back for 1 s before P.","","Uses only the area of the triangle after the turning point, ignoring the 20 m gained while the ball was rising."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[0,4],"y":[-20,20],"xstep":0.5,"ystep":10,"xlabel":"time / s","ylabel":"velocity / m/s","lines":[{"pts":[[0,20],[4,-20]],"c":0}],"points":[{"at":[3,-10],"label":"P"}],"xnums":true,"ynums":true}}
{"id":"ma-fig-078","s":"maths","t":"s2-03","lv":2,"q":"The graph shows the Normal model for the mass of a bag of flour, with standard deviation 8 g. Using the graph, find the probability that a bag's mass is greater than the value marked by line L.","o":["0.894","0.438","0.106","0.211"],"a":2,"x":"The curve peaks at 500 g, so the mean is 500. Line L is at 510 g. $z=(510-500)/8=1.25$. $P(X>510)=1-\\Phi(1.25)=1-0.8944=0.106$.","w":["Gives the area to the left of L, $P(X<510)$, instead of the upper tail the question asks for.","Divides by the variance 64 instead of the standard deviation 8, so uses $z=10/64\\approx0.16$.","","Doubles the tail area, as if both tails beyond 10 g from the mean were wanted."],"fig":{"type":"graph","x":[480,520],"y":[0,0.05],"xstep":5,"ystep":0.01,"xlabel":"mass of bag / g","ylabel":"probability density","lines":[{"pts":[[480.0,0.002191],[480.25,0.002368],[480.5,0.002557],[480.75,0.002758],[481.0,0.002972],[481.25,0.003199],[481.5,0.00344],[481.75,0.003696],[482.0,0.003968],[482.25,0.004255],[482.5,0.004558],[482.75,0.004878],[483.0,0.005215],[483.25,0.005571],[483.5,0.005945],[483.75,0.006337],[484.0,0.006749],[484.25,0.007181],[484.5,0.007633],[484.75,0.008105],[485.0,0.008599],[485.25,0.009113],[485.5,0.009649],[485.75,0.010206],[486.0,0.010785],[486.25,0.011386],[486.5,0.012008],[486.75,0.012652],[487.0,0.013318],[487.25,0.014005],[487.5,0.014713],[487.75,0.015441],[488.0,0.01619],[488.25,0.016959],[488.5,0.017747],[488.75,0.018553],[489.0,0.019377],[489.25,0.020218],[489.5,0.021075],[489.75,0.021947],[490.0,0.022832],[490.25,0.02373],[490.5,0.024639],[490.75,0.025558],[491.0,0.026486],[491.25,0.02742],[491.5,0.02836],[491.75,0.029303],[492.0,0.030248],[492.25,0.031193],[492.5,0.032136],[492.75,0.033075],[493.0,0.034008],[493.25,0.034934],[493.5,0.03585],[493.75,0.036754],[494.0,0.037644],[494.25,0.038518],[494.5,0.039373],[494.75,0.040209],[495.0,0.041022],[495.25,0.041811],[495.5,0.042573],[495.75,0.043307],[496.0,0.04401],[496.25,0.0